### School Admission System — sample requests
### Works in IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code (REST Client extension). Run the app first: mvn spring-boot:run
### All demo users share the password Demo@1234.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@parent = parent:Demo@1234
@meera = meera:Demo@1234
@frontoffice = frontoffice:Demo@1234
@committee = committee:Demo@1234
@accounts = accounts:Demo@1234
@admin = admin:Demo@1234


### 1. Public enquiry form (no auth)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/public/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guardianName": "Test Parent",
  "phone": "9800000999",
  "email": "test.parent@example.com",
  "childName": "Test Child",
  "childDob": "2021-05-01",
  "classCode": "C1",
  "source": "WEBSITE",
  "consent": true
}


### 2. List leads (counsellor)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/leads
Authorization: Basic {{meera}}


### 3. Convert a lead to an application (use an id from step 2, or the demo lead for +919820000109)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/leads/9/convert?academicYear=2027-28
Authorization: Basic {{meera}}


### 4. Classes and seat availability
GET {{host}}/api/v1/classes?academicYear=2027-28
Authorization: Basic {{meera}}


### 5. Guardian: list my applications (Neha Sharma / APP27-000001)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/applications
Authorization: Basic {{parent}}


### 6. Guardian: save draft answers on APP27-000001 (id is 1 in a fresh demo database)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/applications/1
Authorization: Basic {{parent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "childName": "Aanya Sharma",
  "childDob": "2020-08-14",
  "guardianName": "Neha Sharma",
  "guardianPhone": "+919810000001",
  "guardianEmail": "neha.sharma@example.com",
  "responses": {
    "residential_address": "12 MG Road, Pune",
    "transport_required": "Yes"
  }
}


### 7. Guardian: submit the application (ENQUIRY -> APPLICATION)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/applications/1/submit
Authorization: Basic {{parent}}


### 8. What can this application do next, and what is blocking each move?
GET {{host}}/api/v1/applications/1/transitions/available
Authorization: Basic {{meera}}


### 9. Front office: verify a document (id 1 is APP27-000002's birth certificate in the demo data)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/documents/1/verification
Authorization: Basic {{frontoffice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "VERIFIED" }


### 10. Move an application forward once its guards pass (APPLICATION -> REGISTRATION)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/applications/2/transitions
Authorization: Basic {{frontoffice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStage": "REGISTRATION" }


### 11. Committee: record an interaction score (application 4, APP27-000004)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/applications/4/assessments
Authorization: Basic {{committee}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "INTERACTION", "score": 74, "remarks": "Confident, curious, recommended." }


### 12. Committee: move REGISTRATION -> INITIATED once the score passes
POST {{host}}/api/v1/applications/4/transitions
Authorization: Basic {{committee}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStage": "INITIATED" }


### 13. Committee: open payment (INITIATED -> PAYMENT). Holds a seat and issues the invoice.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/applications/4/transitions
Authorization: Basic {{committee}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStage": "PAYMENT" }


### 14. Guardian: see the invoice
GET {{host}}/api/v1/applications/4/invoices
Authorization: Basic {{parent}}


### 15. Guardian: create a gateway order for the invoice (use the invoice id from step 14)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/invoices/1/payments
Authorization: Basic {{parent}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "UPI" }


### 16. DEV ONLY: simulate the gateway capturing the payment and firing its webhook.
### This is what turns the invoice PAID and moves PAYMENT -> ADMITTED automatically.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/dev/payments/{{payment_id}}/capture
Authorization: Basic {{parent}}


### 17. Admission number now assigned
GET {{host}}/api/v1/applications/4
Authorization: Basic {{parent}}


### 18. Reports: seats, sources, funnel
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/seats?academicYear=2027-28
Authorization: Basic {{admin}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/sources
Authorization: Basic {{admin}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/funnel?academicYear=2027-28&classCode=C1
Authorization: Basic {{admin}}


### 19. Messages sent for an application (simulated WhatsApp/SMS/email)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/applications/4/messages
Authorization: Basic {{committee}}


### 20. Waitlist an application (reason required)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/applications/2/transitions
Authorization: Basic {{committee}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toStage": "WAITLISTED", "reason": "No seats left in KG for this cycle" }
